..of the server, right?

> What is going wrong?

Good question.  NFS2 is very vulnerable to network quality, in
particular, if you are using coax, you should check cable lengths,
termination etc etc.

Then there's a question of the server - is it running the same OS?
Does it have a high load, or other kinds of trouble?  Does it say
anything in the syslog?

And, of course, the client machine: do other machines connect without
problems? 

~kzm
