>or not. The LED readout on the back of the VAX displays an number 8
>and stays there after cycling through all the numbers.

Ahh, it has a power switch on the tape drive, so it is probibly a
Reel-to-reel self-loading 9-track drive (probibly a TSV05).
Probibly 'B TS0' if you have a bootable tape.


