to switch off compression by default. It was not possible to 
use any SCSI direct commands, they were connected via TMSCP-emulator
SCSI-card...

Check the www.exabyte.com for the latest firmware and CTSMON program
for the PC. With CTSMON you could create the above mentioned code
load tapes.

