Beware of 60ns 32meg SIMMs. Some of them fail the sizing routine and 
will appear to the system to be only 8 meg. I have confirmed problem
with DEC Alphas & Sun SparcStations, and have received confirmation of
the problem from several vendors, as well as from an AST test engineer.

On the otherhand *70ns* 32meg SIMMs always work and are cheaper (-:

