 Ok, I have one RA-81 on a VAX 11/750 and just took apart the terminator 
located on the "out" connector, the pinout is below...


         top of drive
  --------------------------
  |  out   in              |
  |   /     .              |
  |  / .   . .             |
  |   .     .              |
  |  connector pins        |
  |                        |
  --------------------------

Jump the pins marked with "/"



